UNKZ and Vertex. Each faction has its own style in both design and gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269540/extras/655b6e3129de8c958073dc1bb5884106.avif?t=1764021090\" width=1232 height=500 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE COMMANDERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Commanders function both as playable characters and bosses! Each Commander has their own set of abilities and unique dialogue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269540/extras/e1f4d030c3eeececf2b21c4ce2083dd5.avif?t=1764021090\" width=616 height=347 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONQUER THE MAP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture territory, gather resources and gain enough power to challenge the rival Commander at the end!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269540/extras/3b9b73a8322dc97df9e9a973ad4561d3.poster.avif?t=1764021090\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269540/extras/3b9b73a8322dc97df9e9a973ad4561d3.webm?t=1764021090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269540/extras/3b9b73a8322dc97df9e9a973ad4561d3.mp4?t=1764021090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REPLAYABILITY!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of items and consumables with wild combos, events and dozens of battle maps make each run of ANIWARS a unique experience!  </p>","developers":["Breaker Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"S